			"widgets_values":[
				"Cinematic high-end furniture commercial, 15-second fluid camera motion. \n\n0-5s: Extreme close-up shot, the camera starts with a soft sliding motion across the cream-colored fabric surface of the sofa, highlighting the delicate, plush texture and tactile weave. Shallow depth of field, natural soft light grazing the fabric, creating subtle highlights and soft shadows that emphasize the premium material quality.\n\n5-10s: The camera pulls back smoothly and tracks horizontally, gradually revealing the full form of the modular sofa. The motion is fluid and continuous, transitioning from the texture detail to the overall structural silhouette. The surrounding minimalist living room space, including the sleek floor lamp, the geometric wall accent, and the circular coffee table, slowly enters the frame, establishing a sense of scale and sophisticated interior atmosphere.\n\n10-15s: The camera performs a slow, elegant parallax orbit around the sofa, maintaining a steady, cinematic glide. The light subtly shifts across the scene, enhancing the depth of the space. The composition remains balanced and serene, focusing on the comfort and luxury of the piece. The movement continues with a gentle, floating momentum, never coming to a hard stop, fading out in a state of graceful, continuous flow. High-end aesthetic, professional stabilization, photorealistic rendering, neutral color palette, serene and minimalist luxury vibe."
